{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_title", "source_sha256": "ea1fe9b8e8b2ffacba93f2c1ec5239186e38bdcc7de762215052f115923e19a7", "ja": "そして少女達は立ち上がった", "zh": "于是，少女们奋发向上", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fd9d50241084246ce50bf6d7f2dfb6b16220cd089a743e4c1528ce275e5eebcb", "ja": "センターとはすなわち主人公！\nはりきる百合子だったが、日夜繰り広げられ\nる仲間たちとの特訓は前途多難！　メンバー\nに支えられつつ困難に耐え抜いた百合子は、\n仲間たちと共にステージを成功させる！", "zh": "Center也就是所谓的主角！\n百合子卯足全力练习，但她和同伴日以继夜\n进行的特训却前途多舛！在团员的支持下，\n跨越重重困难的百合子，和同伴一起成功\n完成表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8499db94be14b1a18b6c39c4b4a3dd5b7fcbd3fe401d22088d0cb056fe8a3929", "ja": "みんな、話の途中に悪いな。\n……百合子、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "各位，不好意思打断你们聊天。\n……百合子，方便说一下话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "4d8b75604a42c643b63abd8020764e84e9ba74f6c92ffd1c3ef923f380d8e891", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！？\nお、お疲れさまです。あの、何か……？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？\n辛、辛苦你了。请问，有什么事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1002_p", "source_sha256": "78cdc58bdfca572aa1706de7f8699879b35eee77e31f35f5d1817357111a02e6", "ja": "実は、次の公演のセンターを、\n百合子にやってもらおうと思ってるんだけど。", "zh": "其实我想让百合子来担任\n下次公演的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "908396f0d7eb4460f62c80a199d16b6a458e69e2d2a4f76a1fad9880a7043779", "ja": "次の公演の、センター……\n私が、センター……って。", "zh": "下次公演的……Center……\n我当……Center……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "387e5dba5b5fcb73b3800fec3079d2aa3b671f4249cf15c453b2f16072cb5a4a", "ja": "え、えええええっ！！？", "zh": "咦、咦咦咦咦咦！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3b435e6fecc96ac571cde9731ad9e20b5001a424628503a450c455403241c0f9", "ja": "いや、そんなに驚かなくても……。", "zh": "那个，也不需要那么惊讶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "5425febf0bfda72988714d27f0339dca91100fec4e76bf5dda330acfebe60d58", "ja": "だだだ、だって、センターですよ！？\n私が、しゅ、主人公みたいなものってことで……！", "zh": "可可可、可是，是Center唷！？\n由我来当像、像是主角一样的角色……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "25b7f0905919e77541f6c7cbfa05bd72ef1a61ed958914657ca272bab6ce0cd5", "ja": "えっ……センター！？　すごい！\nおめでとう、百合子！", "zh": "咦……Center！？好棒喔！\n恭喜你，百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "dce08fcb50faf756f1b534624986ef283b65e946b3c63d7c4742fd072575439d", "ja": "ん……百合子さん、すごい……ね。\nおめでとう、ございます……。", "zh": "嗯……百合子好厉害……\n恭喜你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "0b6071b2afd9844ea5e825443e1855ad35583e1a5fd99093ddc15106d03f4adb", "ja": "先を越されちゃったのは、ちょっと悔しいけど……\n私に協力できることがあったら、なんでも言ってね！", "zh": "虽然被你抢先一步，有点不甘心……\n但只要有我帮得上忙的地方，你尽管开口！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "3f8ea9ac2e52c1fd85c1130fccb165a6ce803751a4edcce293e8e279e447fdd1", "ja": "杏奈も……応援、する……。", "zh": "杏奈也会……替你加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "48b60ad810061a18fb2a3d6ae3d387ae2a6668e3ef1c5e9d99da09f0e828a3e2", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、紗代子さん……。\nふたりとも、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "小杏、纱代子……\n谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "d551027e965f1de98d905016d8c6f1f226c6c7e7ea3ef5dc94735ecfcad7c7f0", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n私、覚悟を決めました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我做好觉悟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "cdeee1a5dca63fa2ecb26ecf18490b4ef16b1a1c4a94d31da621ff81413344eb", "ja": "次の公演……主人公の名に恥じないように、\n精いっぱい頑張りますね！", "zh": "下次的公演……我会努力加油，\n不让主角之名蒙羞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d920845e78e9721666543fbc3be4ecd9c706c56d9cf7358a1cb902cb76102217", "ja": "主人公とはちょっと違うんだが……まぁいいか。\nそれじゃ、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "好像和主角有点不太一样……算了，没关系。\n那就拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "ca939ab70d11ce9f42cdad68a37966a8c39bce476d08726b4fc30639aa18c93a", "ja": "はいっ♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_006_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ab99f07629848339c6d92a6ff5060f368bbf74eb83f4ff2724de5324c7036434", "ja": "（紗代子も杏奈も、力になってくれるみたいだし。\n百合子のセンター公演、いいものになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（纱代子和杏奈也都很愿意帮忙的样子。\n相信百合子的Center公演一定会很精彩！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
